---
import DocsLayout from '../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
import PageHeader from './PageHeader.astro';
import Callout from './Callout.astro';
import CodeBlock from './CodeBlock.astro';

interface Props { lang: 'en' | 'id' }
const { lang } = Astro.props;
const id = lang === 'id';
---

<DocsLayout title={id ? 'Memulai' : 'Getting Started'}>
  <PageHeader
    eyebrow="Quick start"
    title={id ? 'Dari container sampai pesan pertama' : 'From container to first message'}
    description={id
      ? 'Jalur production paling pendek menggunakan image GHCR proyek, satu origin HTTPS, dan first-run setup dari dashboard.'
      : 'The shortest production path uses the project GHCR image, one HTTPS origin, and first-run setup from the dashboard.'}
  />

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mb-3">1. {id ? 'Prasyarat' : 'Prerequisites'}</h2>
  <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-sm text-[#a1a1aa] space-y-2 mb-8">
    <li>Docker Engine + Docker Compose v2.</li>
    <li>{id ? 'Satu akun WhatsApp yang dapat membuka Linked devices.' : 'One WhatsApp account that can access Linked devices.'}</li>
    <li>{id ? 'Satu origin HTTPS melalui reverse proxy, tunnel, atau router PaaS untuk deployment publik.' : 'One HTTPS origin through a reverse proxy, tunnel, or PaaS router for public deployment.'}</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mb-3">2. {id ? 'Clone dan konfigurasi origin' : 'Clone and configure the origin'}</h2>
  <CodeBlock label="shell" code={`git clone https://github.com/howlil/wago.git\ncd wago\ncp .env.production.example .env`} />
  <CodeBlock label=".env" code={`CORS_ORIGIN=https://wago.example.com\nAPI_KEY=`} />
  <Callout title={id ? 'API_KEY opsional' : 'API_KEY is optional'}>
    {id
      ? 'Biarkan API_KEY kosong untuk first-run setup dari dashboard. Jika ingin mengunci gateway sebelum URL publik dapat diklaim, isi API_KEY dengan secret random yang panjang sebelum container dijalankan.'
      : 'Leave API_KEY empty for first-run setup from the dashboard. If the gateway must be locked before the public URL can be claimed, set API_KEY to a long random secret before starting the container.'}
  </Callout>

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mt-9 mb-3">3. {id ? 'Jalankan service' : 'Start the service'}</h2>
  <CodeBlock label="shell" code={`docker compose pull\ndocker compose up -d\ndocker compose ps\ncurl http://127.0.0.1:3000/health`} />
  <p class="text-sm text-[#a1a1aa] mb-8">{id ? 'Compose bind ke 127.0.0.1:3000. Reverse proxy/tunnel meneruskan origin HTTPS publik ke service ini.' : 'Compose binds to 127.0.0.1:3000. A reverse proxy or tunnel forwards the public HTTPS origin to this service.'}</p>

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mb-3">4. {id ? 'Bootstrap dan Pair WhatsApp' : 'Bootstrap and pair WhatsApp'}</h2>
  <ol class="list-decimal pl-5 text-sm text-[#a1a1aa] space-y-2 mb-4">
    <li>{id ? 'Buka dashboard Wago pada CORS_ORIGIN yang dikonfigurasi.' : 'Open the Wago dashboard at the configured CORS_ORIGIN.'}</li>
    <li>{id ? 'Pada fresh gateway tanpa API_KEY, klik Pair WhatsApp. Dashboard otomatis membuat kandidat API key, melakukan first-run bootstrap, lalu memulai pairing.' : 'On a fresh gateway without API_KEY, click Pair WhatsApp. The dashboard automatically creates an API-key candidate, performs first-run bootstrap, then starts pairing.'}</li>
    <li>{id ? 'Simpan raw API key yang ditampilkan bila external REST client akan menggunakannya. Backend hanya menyimpan hash untuk generated key.' : 'Save the displayed raw API key if an external REST client will use it. The backend stores only the hash for a generated key.'}</li>
    <li>{id ? 'Buka WhatsApp → Linked devices → Link a device dan scan QR.' : 'Open WhatsApp → Linked devices → Link a device and scan the QR.'}</li>
  </ol>
  <p class="text-sm text-[#71717a] mb-8">{id ? 'Jika API_KEY sudah diprovision atau gateway pernah diinisialisasi, masukkan existing API key pada Gateway Credentials terlebih dahulu. First-run bootstrap tidak membuat key baru setelah credential sudah ada.' : 'If API_KEY was pre-provisioned or the gateway was already initialized, enter the existing API key in Gateway Credentials first. First-run bootstrap does not create a new key after credentials already exist.'}</p>

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mb-3">5. {id ? 'Izinkan recipient' : 'Allow a recipient'}</h2>
  <p class="text-sm text-[#a1a1aa] mb-4">{id ? 'Recipient dapat di-allow dari dashboard, atau melalui REST API berikut.' : 'A recipient can be allowed from the dashboard, or through the REST API below.'}</p>
  <CodeBlock label="cURL" code={`export WAGO_URL="https://wago.example.com"\nexport WAGO_API_KEY="your-api-key"\n\ncurl -X POST "$WAGO_URL/recipients/allow" \\\n  -H "Authorization: Bearer $WAGO_API_KEY" \\\n  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \\\n  -d '{"phone":"6281234567890","label":"Demo recipient"}'`} />

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mt-9 mb-3">6. {id ? 'Kirim pesan' : 'Send a message'}</h2>
  <p class="text-sm text-[#a1a1aa] mb-4">{id ? 'Gunakan form Send Message di dashboard atau endpoint API.' : 'Use the Send Message form in the dashboard or the API endpoint.'}</p>
  <CodeBlock label="cURL" code={`curl -X POST "$WAGO_URL/messages/send" \\\n  -H "Authorization: Bearer $WAGO_API_KEY" \\\n  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \\\n  -H "Idempotency-Key: demo-001" \\\n  -d '{"to":"6281234567890","text":"Hello from Wago"}'`} />
  <Callout title={id ? 'Arti HTTP 202' : 'What HTTP 202 means'} tone="warning">
    {id ? 'Response 202/pending berarti operasi outbound diterima oleh layer Wago/Baileys. Ini bukan bukti pesan sudah delivered atau read.' : 'A 202/pending response means the outbound operation was accepted by the Wago/Baileys layer. It is not proof that the message was delivered or read.'}
  </Callout>

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mt-9 mb-3">7. {id ? 'Cek status dan activity' : 'Check status and activity'}</h2>
  <CodeBlock label="cURL" code={`curl "$WAGO_URL/messages/<message-id>/status" \\\n  -H "Authorization: Bearer $WAGO_API_KEY"\n\ncurl "$WAGO_URL/activity?limit=20" \\\n  -H "Authorization: Bearer $WAGO_API_KEY"`} />
  <p class="text-sm text-[#71717a]">{id ? 'Message status bersifat transient dan hilang saat proses restart. Activity log operator disimpan secara persisten di /app/data/activity-log.json dengan batas 300 event.' : 'Message status is transient and is lost when the process restarts. The operator activity log is persisted at /app/data/activity-log.json and capped at 300 events.'}</p>
</DocsLayout>
